&lt;li&gt;Skill in balancing technical debt reduction with feature development and operational excellence.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong communication skills with the ability to influence across teams and socialize security best practices.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
