&lt;h3&gt;Minimum requirements&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;10+ years of experience in a customer-facing engineering role such as solution consultant, solutions architect, or sales engineer for a global software enterprise&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong technical acumen in API integrations, SaaS platforms, and enterprise architectures, with an understanding of how technology partners build and scale integrated solutions&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience working with technology partner ecosystems and payment solutions&lt;/li&gt;
