&lt;h2&gt;What you&#39;ll do&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Stripe is seeking an experienced accounting data analyst to join the world-class Accounting team and help us scale for the future, in a fast-paced environment that&#39;s growing rapidly. You&#39;ll support the processing and reporting of our global financial results.&lt;/p&gt;
