&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with partner program structures and how marketplaces drive distribution and adoption.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience working with the startup founder or developer audience.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Background in payments, fintech, or infrastructure platforms.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Enough technical literacy to navigate API documentation and work credibly with developer-facing products and partners — comfortable translating integration patterns into user-facing messaging.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with ecosystem or marketplace metrics such as app adoption rates, marketplace attach, partner-sourced pipeline, or partner program health indicators.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;

